<title>FRANCE: CSA update - French Socialists/allies 287 seats.</title>
<headline>CSA update - French Socialists/allies 287 seats.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>A CSA polling institute update on the French parliamentary election runoff, which appeared on TV after 2000 GMT, showed the Socialists and allies winning 287 seats and the Communist party taking 36 seats.</p>
<p>A total of 289 seats is required for an absolute majority.</p>
<p>The update showed the centre-right taking 253 seats and the extreme-right winning one seat.</p>
</text>
